\* Finding 2 with two workers: the repositories.add crawl and the org crawl
\* fetch the same PR at once.
\* Smaller bounds: a second lane that runs at the same time grows the state space fast.
\* @...@ values are read from the code by check.sh.
SPECIFICATION Spec
CONSTANTS
    PRs = {1, 2}
    MaxTime = 1
    MaxUpdates = 2
    MaxFails = 0
    MaxHourly = 1
    Workers = 2
    StopInclusive = @StopInclusive@
    AdvanceNeedsAllSaved = @AdvanceNeedsAllSaved@
    TargetedNeverAdvances = @TargetedNeverAdvances@
    SaveGuard = @SaveGuard@
    SameSecondUpdates = FALSE
    WithRepoAdd = TRUE
    WithPageRefresh = FALSE
    PartialListing = FALSE
INVARIANTS TypeOK RawNeverGoesBack
